sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant AuthorService
    participant AuthorRepository
    participant Database

    Client->>AuthorService: delete(id)
    Note over AuthorService: Client calls AuthorService.delete with author ID

    activate AuthorService
    AuthorService->>AuthorService: findById(id)
    Note over AuthorService: AuthorService calls findById to verify existence

    alt Author found
        AuthorService->>AuthorRepository: deleteById(id)
        Note over AuthorRepository: repository.deleteById executed

        activate AuthorRepository
        AuthorRepository->>Database: DELETE FROM authors WHERE id = ?
        Note over Database: Author removed from database

        activate Database
        Database-->>AuthorRepository: return success
        Note over Database: Deletion completed
        deactivate Database

        AuthorRepository-->>AuthorService: return
        deactivate AuthorRepository

        AuthorService-->>Client: return success
        Note over Client: Deletion confirmed
    else Author not found
        AuthorService->>AuthorService: throw ObjectNotFoundException
        Note over AuthorService: ObjectNotFoundException if author does not exist

        AuthorService-->>Client: ObjectNotFoundException propagates
        Note over Client: Exception propagates to caller
    end

    deactivate AuthorService
